<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IDEC rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IDEC rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg said analyst David Webber initiated coverage of IDEC Pharmaceuticals Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated a loss of $0.22 per share for 1997 and a profit of $0.16 for 1998, compared to a loss of $0.34 for 1996.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $46.</p>
<p>-- The shares rose 3/4 to 23-1/2.</p>
</text>
